<title>CANADA: Alberta Wheat Pool details harvest progress.</title>
<headline>Alberta Wheat Pool details harvest progress.</headline>
<dateline>WINNIPEG 1996-09-20</dateline>
<text>
<p>Alberta Wheat Pool on Friday detailed the level of harvest progress to Sept 20.</p>
<p>CROP			  COMBINED (PCT)</p>
<p>Hard Red Spring Wheat	 41</p>
<p>Canada Prairie Spring	 25</p>
<p>Soft White Spring Wheat     93</p>
<p>Winter Wheat		   100</p>
<p>Durum Wheat		     82</p>
<p>Oats				28</p>
<p>Barley			    53</p>
<p>Flax				13</p>
<p>Fall Rye			  84</p>
<p>Canola			    48</p>
<p>Average			   46</p>
<p>-- Gilbert Le Gras 204 947 3548</p>
</text>
